 "description": "BIGVILLE R15 (block 263000) -- THE VIOLENT ACT. bv_trigger is the value-DECISION to commit violence (trigger_value = snap_pressure + w_spite*spite_gain + hunger*desperation_gain vs trigger_threshold, gated on STAMINA energy>=attack_cost) -- the outward form of the 242 frustration-SNAP / spite / DESPERATION, NOT random; bv_refrain is the disjoint decline arm (ablate the trigger -> refrain, no act). A committed ViolentAct{amount,cost} costs BOTH: bv_harm_victim drops the victim's HEALTH by amount (the R14 acute arm, last_cause=5 violence -> R14 bl_death routes death_cause=5 at zero -- the FIFTH route to death) and bv_cost_aggressor drops the aggressor's STAMINA (R1 energy) by cost. Magnitude is a scalar. NO reward/punishment token. ZERO new Rust.",
